msgstr ""
"Tabdart n yisenfal ulac-itt akka tura.\n"
"\n"
"Ttxil-k·m seqdec http://launchpad.net/ubuntu/+source/%s/%s/+changelog\n"
"alamma isenfal uɣalen llan neɣ εreḍ tikkelt-nniḍen ticki."

